              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 49:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unamura amaso yawe weraguze, urābe, bose bakoraniye hamwe baza kuri wewe; abahungu bawe bazoza baturutse kure, n’ abakobga bawe bazoza bateruwe mu kwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.34.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 34:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ho uzorāba, mu maso hawe hakeyuka, umutima wawe ukadidagizwa n’umunezero, ukāguka; kukw ibidandazwa vy’ibitayega bica mu kiyaga bizogaruka i wawe, n’ubutunzi bg’ amahanga buzokuzako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isinzi ry’ingamiya rizogutwikira, inyana z’ingamiya z’i Midiyani n’izo muri Efa. Abaturutse i Sheba bose bazoza, bazoba bazanye izahabu n’imibavu, bavuge inkuru nziza z’ishimwe ry’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.56.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 56:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAG.2.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hag 2:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imikuku yose y’i Kedari izokoranirizwa kuri wewe, amapfizi y’intama y’i Nebayoti azogukorera; azokwūrira igicaniro canje yemerwe, nzokwubahiriza inzu yanje y’icubahiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ni ba nde baguruka nk’igicu, kandi nk’ inuma zisubira mu turyango tw’ ivyari vyazo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.51.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "51:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.55.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "55:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ababa ku kiyaga banyiteze, amāto y’i Tarushishi ni yo abītangiye imbere, azanye abahungu bawe abakūye kure, bazanye ifeza zabo n’ izahabu kubg’ izina ryanje, jewe Uhoraho Imana yawe, Uwera w’Abisirayeli, kuko nakwubahirije.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
