            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamahanga bazokwubaka inzitiro zawe, n’abami babo bazogukorera; kuko nagukubise ndatse, ariko nkugiriye imbabazi ndagutunze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 21:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amarembo yawe azokwama yuguruye, ntazokwugarirwa ku murango canke mw ijoro, kugira ngw abantu bakuzanire ubutunzi bg’amahanga, bo n’abami bayo babashoreye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.14.17+ZEC.14.18+ZEC.14.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 14:17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ihanga n’ubgami bitazokwemera kugukorera bizohona; ni koko ayo mahanga azogesezwa rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 41:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubgiza bg’i Lebanoni buzokuzako, ibiti vy’amasederi n’ ivy’ imitidari n’ivy’ imiteyashuri bizozira hamwe, kugira ngo bisharize ahēra hanje, kand’ aho nshira ibirenge vyanje nzohubahiriza: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
