        },
        {
          "text": "Mu gishingo c’imiringa nzozana izahabu, no mu gishingo c’ivyuma nzozana ifeza; nzane imiringa mu gishingo c’ibiti, n’ ivyuma mu gishingo c’amabuye; nzokwimika amahoro abe ari yo akuganza, n’ukugororoka abe ari kwo kugutwara. ",
