            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izuba si ryo rizoba rikikubera umuco ku murango, cank’ ukwezi ngo kukuboneshereze: ariko jewe Uhoraho ni jewe nzokubera umuco utazoshira, kandi jewe Imana yawe ni jewe nzokubera icubahiro. ",
          "type": "text",
